deleted file mode 100644
--- a/src/main/java/com/xhl/C06_Algorithm_Skills/LeetCode/LeetCode100/BinaryTree/levelTraverse.java	(revision 687c25e08465fffb2273701aa0d7f5d07c2010ac)
